Subject: [PATCH 79/85] hw/misc: ADC Click (MCP3204) on mikroBUS

ADC Click v100: the MCP3204 model with its four inputs on the Click's
terminals (through MCP6284 buffers), VREF 3.3 V (J1 on VCC, J2 on
3V3), CS# pulled up by R7 (100 kOhm). "in0".."in3" set the inputs.

qtests: the four channels and a differential read on the MC00's EXT1,
CH2 through SPI0 on the AVR64EA48 Nano Base's socket 1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
